<title>TUNISIA: SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT NAMIBIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT NAMIBIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia beat Namibia 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in their World Cup soccer Africain zone group two qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Tunisia - Zoubeir Beya 19, 57, Skander Soueyah 31, Jamel Limam 72)</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
